        {
            "Id": 141392014,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141392,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……从前有一个大国，那里有一位聪慧而优秀的女王。/n虽经历过波折，百姓依然热爱她带来的安定统治。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1413920130",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "302"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141392015,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141392,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "然而，其中一名百姓虽然尊敬女王，却察觉到一件事。/n这个国家的陋习，会不会正在束缚女王。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1413920140",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "302"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141392016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141392,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "就在此时，国家遭遇了一场危难。/n为了拯救这场危难，也为了拯救迎战危难的女王，那名百姓站出来战斗。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1413920150",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "302"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141392017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141392,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "她倾听那些畏惧陋习之人的声音，做了自己该做的事。/n最重要的是，她怀着对国家、对女王的心意而战。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1413920160",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "302"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141392018,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141392,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 18,
            "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "可是……那名百姓的战斗，却被女王亲自制止。/n不仅如此，女王甚至遵循原本的陋习，成功渡过了国难。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1413920170",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "302"
        },
